    "reasoning": "Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index divided by 100 at the exact effort; the cell names its index version, and different versions are not comparable.",
    "implementation": "CursorBench 4.0 resolved-task rate at the exact effort; candidates without a CursorBench row keep their DeepSWE v1.1 rate, a separate scale that runs about 30 points higher for the same model.",
    "task-cost": "DeepSWE average task cost only when the benchmark names the exact model and effort. An equivalent launch tuple may transfer across harnesses; effort-level proxies remain unknown.",
    "agentic": "AA-Briefcase v1.1 Elo at the exact effort, mapped as (Elo - 500) / 2000.",
    "ui": "Percentile of the dated Arena WebDev rank at the exact effort.",
    "spatial-3d": "Percentile of the dated Design Arena 3D rank at the exact effort.",
    "conservative": "A documented lower estimate reflecting effort or harness transfer and evidence confidence; it is the value used for routing.",
    "boundary": "Public research only. No local model evaluation contributes capability scores; missing direct evidence remains unknown or is labeled as a proxy on the capability evidence itself.",
    "scale": "Every known cell names its benchmark and version in scale. Scores on different scales are not comparable; the brief letters each scale where a column mixes them."
  },
